# AnswerThePublic

> AnswerThePublic is a search listening and keyword research platform that surfaces the questions, prepositions, comparisons and related searches real people are typing into search engines. Marketers, SEOs, content creators, PR teams and consumer insight researchers use it to discover content ideas, understand audience intent, and build campaigns grounded in real search data across multiple languages and regions.

